{
  "title": "Telephony: Make and Take Calls from the Browser | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Phone calls are still how many customers reach you, but a desk phone knows nothing about the customer on the other end. The CrestApps Telephony module puts a phone in the browser, next to your Orchard Core site: you connect your phone system once, choose the default provider, and every user places and takes calls from the same screen.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why a browser phone, and how providers, the soft phone and extensions fit together\n• The features behind the phone\n• Connecting Asterisk, for a phone system your company runs\n• Connecting Telnyx, for a phone service in the cloud\n• Choosing the default provider and the soft phone options\n• Giving people extensions\n• The soft phone: keypad, extension dialing, recent calls and voicemail\n• The permissions that decide who can use it",
